            "comprehends": [
             "copies/rb861vm6094#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil on buff paper, five figures without separators. The 7 carries the crossbar; the two 2s match each other. The second figure is the two-lobed 8 of these hands, which read as a 6 would make the day 16."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
